## Summary

Finalize GitHub Actions trigger and branch-protection reliability: confirm workflow_dispatch and ready_for_review handling, designate the single required pr-gate check, codify no-empty-commits-as-CI-prods, and capture branch-protection truth read-only (mark UNKNOWN if admin access unavailable).

## Scope

Allowlist-bound; see commit.allowlist. Out of scope: Do not add new secrets or elevated permissions. Do not use pull_request_target for PR-controlled code. Do not mutate branch protection. Do not rename required checks beyond the designated pr-gate.

## Validation

See commit.verify; embedded audit + proof bundle required.

